<!-- 文章正文 -->
<article class="article-content gh-content-dz" id="articleContent">
    <!--kg-card-begin: html--><div class="tocbot"><!--kg-card-end: html--><p><strong>The official AliExpress dropshipping solution that automates your product sourcing, ordering, and fulfillment</strong></p><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="note" data-toc="Note">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    Note
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>If you're new to dropshipping or switching from another tool, you've probably heard of DSers but aren't sure exactly what it does—or why you need it.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/06/QQ_1782104699690.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1911" height="818" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/06/QQ_1782104699690.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w1000/2026/06/QQ_1782104699690.png 1000w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w1600/2026/06/QQ_1782104699690.png 1600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/06/QQ_1782104699690.png 1911w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"><figcaption>DSers Overview</figcaption></figure><p>This article gives you a clear, no‑fluff overview of DSers: what it is, what it can do for your business, and why thousands of dropshippers use it every day.</p><!--kg-card-begin: html--><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" target="_blank" style="
    display: flex; 
    justify-content: space-between; 
    align-items: center; 
    background-color: #f9f9f9; 
    padding: 15px 25px; 
    border-radius: 50px; 
    text-decoration: none; 
    color: #000; 
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; 
    font-weight: 600; 
    font-size: 16px; 
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); 
    transition: all 0.3s ease; 
    max-width: 100%; 
    margin: 20px 0;
