    </svg>
  </span>
</a><!--kg-card-end: html--><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="what-is-dsers" data-toc="What Is DSers?">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    What Is DSers?
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>DSers is the <strong>official AliExpress, Alibaba and 1688 Dropshipping partner</strong>. Think of it as a bridge between supply platforms (where suppliers list products) and your online store (where customers buy).</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/1.20-AliExpress-Dropshipping-Tool-----01.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1200" height="760" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/05/1.20-AliExpress-Dropshipping-Tool-----01.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w1000/2026/05/1.20-AliExpress-Dropshipping-Tool-----01.png 1000w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/1.20-AliExpress-Dropshipping-Tool-----01.png 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"><figcaption>What is DSers</figcaption></figure><p>Without DSers, fulfilling a single order takes 5–10 minutes of manual work: copy customer address → log into AliExpress → select correct variant → paste address → place order → copy tracking number → paste back to your store.</p><p>With DSers, that same order takes <strong>less than 10 seconds</strong>. And you can process <strong>100+ orders at once</strong>.</p><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="what-can" data-toc="What Can DSers Do for Your Business?">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    What Can DSers Do for Your Business?
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>Here are the core features that save you time and help you scale:</p><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding:3px"></p>
<h3 id="one-click-import">1. One-Click Product Import</h3>
<p></p><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>Browse AliExpress as usual. When you find a product you want to sell, click the DSers Chrome extension button. The product (title, images, variants, description) imports instantly to your DSers dashboard—no manual copying.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779700596729.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="708" height="399" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/05/QQ_1779700596729.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779700596729.png 708w"><figcaption>Import Products from AliExpress by DSers Chrom extension</figcaption></figure><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding:3px"></p>
<h3 id="bulk order placement">2. Bulk Order Placement</h3>
<p></p><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>When customers buy from your store, all orders appear in DSers automatically. You can select <strong>up to 100 orders</strong> and place them on AliExpress with a single click. DSers auto‑fills the customer's shipping address and matches variants for you.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779701390365.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="976" height="627" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/05/QQ_1779701390365.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779701390365.png 976w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"><figcaption>Bulk place order on DSers</figcaption></figure><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding:3px"></p>
<h3 id="automatic tracking sync">3. Automatic Tracking Sync</h3>
<p></p><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>After the supplier ships the order, DSers grabs the tracking number and <strong>automatically updates your store</strong> and your customer. No copy‑paste. No manual emails.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/06/QQ_1782104587422.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="998" height="59" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/06/QQ_1782104587422.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/06/QQ_1782104587422.png 998w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"><figcaption>Auto Tracking Sync</figcaption></figure><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding:3px"></p>
<h3 id=price and inventory sync">4. Price and Inventory Sync</h3>
<p></p><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>Suppliers change prices or run out of stock. DSers notifies you (and can automatically update your store prices on paid plans). You'll never sell a product at a loss or oversell out‑of‑stock items.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779702382212.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="703" height="96" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/05/QQ_1779702382212.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779702382212.png 703w"><figcaption>Auto Inventory Update</figcaption></figure><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779702398207.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="705" height="94" srcset="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/size/w600/2026/05/QQ_1779702398207.png 600w, https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779702398207.png 705w"><figcaption>Auto Price Update</figcaption></figure><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding:3px"></p>
<h3 id= product editing & Optimization">5. Product Editing & Optimization</h3>
<p></p><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>Supplier listings often have messy titles and descriptions. DSers lets you edit everything—or use <strong>AI tools</strong> to generate cleaner titles, better descriptions, and enhanced images before pushing products to your store.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779703177778.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="564" height="912"><figcaption>Product AI Edit Function</figcaption></figure><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding:3px"></p>
<h3 id="multi-store management">6. Multi-Store Management</h3>
<p></p><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>Running multiple Shopify or WooCommerce stores? DSers connects to all of them from one account. Manage products and fulfill orders across stores without logging in and out.</p><figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"><img src="https://help.dsers.com/content/images/2026/05/QQ_1779703206505.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="195" height="615"><figcaption>DSers Partner stores</figcaption></figure><hr><h2 id="how-dsers-compares-to-manual-dropshipping">How DSers Compares to Manual Dropshipping</h2><!--kg-card-begin: html--><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #e2e6ec; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.4;">
  <thead>
    <tr style="background: #f6f8fa; border-bottom: 1px solid #dce0e6;">
      <th style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #e2e6ec;">Task</th>
      <th style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #e2e6ec;">Manual</th>
      <th style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">With DSers</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>

  <tbody>
    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f4;">
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Import product</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Copy-paste 5+ fields</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px;">One click</td>
    </tr>

    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f4;">
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Place 1 order</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">5-10 minutes</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px;">10 seconds</td>
    </tr>

    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f4;">
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Place 100 orders</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Hours</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px;">One click</td>
    </tr>

    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f4;">
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Update tracking</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Copy-paste each</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Automatic</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Price changes</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f4;">Check daily manually</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Auto-sync (paid plans)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table><!--kg-card-end: html--><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="what-platform" data-toc="What Platforms Does DSers Support?">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    What Platforms Does DSers Support?
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>DSers works with:</p><p><strong>Shopify</strong> (most popular)</p><p><strong>Wix</strong></p><p><strong>WooCommerce</strong></p><p>eBay</p><p>Tiktok</p><p>Jumpseller</p><p>Cartpanda</p><p>Amazon</p><p>SQUARESPACE</p><p>Big Cartel</p><p>Square</p><p>Ecwid</p><p>BigCommerce</p><p>Genstore.ai</p><p>LPQV</p><p>Walmart</p><p>Magento</p><p>Shopline</p><p>The connection takes less than three minutes and requires no coding.</p><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="do-you" data-toc="Do I Need to Pay to Start?">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    Do I Need to Pay to Start?
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p><strong>No.</strong> DSers has a <strong>Free Plan</strong> that includes:</p><ul><li>Up to 3,000 products</li><li>Up to 3 connected stores</li><li>Up to 50 orders per month</li><li>1 user account</li></ul><p>As your business grows, you can upgrade to <strong>Advanced, Pro, or Enterprise</strong> plans for higher limits, AI features, faster sync speeds, and priority support.</p><blockquote>💡 <strong>Pro Tip</strong>: Most beginners start with the Free Plan. It's fully functional and you can upgrade anytime.</blockquote><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="who-is" data-toc="Who Is DSers For?">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    Who Is DSers For?
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>DSers is built for:</p><ul><li><strong>Beginners</strong> – Simple setup, clear dashboard, no technical skills needed</li><li><strong>Growing stores</strong> – Bulk processing helps you scale without hiring help</li><li><strong>Multi‑store owners</strong> – Manage everything from one place</li><li><strong>Former Oberlo users</strong> – DSers is the #1 Oberlo alternative</li></ul><hr><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
<h2 id="next" data-toc="What's Next?">
  <div style="padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(0, 150, 136, 0.03); border-left: 7px solid #009688;">
    What's Next?
  </div>
</h2><!--kg-card-end: html--><p>Now that you understand what DSers does, it's time to set it up:</p><p>👉 <a href="https://help.dsers.com/p/2fb7fd8c-5b9a-4a4a-9917-c5b3669c4f00/"><strong>[Create Your DSers Account: Sign Up Step by Step]</strong></a></p><p>👉 <strong><a href="https://help.dsers.com/binding-get-started-in-3-minutes-connect-dsers-to-your-store/">[Get Started in 3 Minutes: Connect DSers to Your Store]</a></strong></p><!--kg-card-begin: html--><p style="padding-bottom:30px"></p>
