  </li>
</ol><!--kg-card-end: html--><!--kg-card-begin: html--><section style="margin:48px 0;font-family:inherit;width:100%;clear:both;" data-dsers-faq-block>
  <h2 id="FAQ" data-toc="FAQ Section" style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;">
    <div style="padding:20px;background-color:rgba(0,150,136,0.03);border-left:7px solid #009688;">
      FAQ Section
    </div>
  </h2>

  <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#5f6b7a;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
    Everything you need to know about DSers—the official AliExpress dropshipping partner that automates product sourcing, ordering, and fulfillment.
  </p>

  <div style="display:block;width:100%;clear:both;">

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        What is DSers and who is it for?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          DSers is the official AliExpress dropshipping partner that automates product sourcing, ordering, and fulfillment. It's built for beginners, growing stores, multi-store owners, and former Oberlo users—no technical skills needed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        What should I know before signing up for DSers?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          You can start with the Free Plan which includes up to 3,000 products, 3 connected stores, and 50 orders per month. DSers supports multiple sales channels including Shopify, WooCommerce, Wix, eBay, Amazon, and more. You can upgrade anytime as your business grows.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        What happens after I sign up?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          You'll connect your sales channel (takes less than 3 minutes, no coding required), then you can start importing products from AliExpress using the Chrome extension and fulfilling orders automatically.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        How does DSers save me time compared to manual dropshipping?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          Manual fulfillment takes 5–10 minutes per order—copying addresses, placing orders, pasting tracking numbers. With DSers, the same order takes less than 10 seconds, and you can process 100+ orders at once.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        Can I use DSers with multiple stores?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          Yes. DSers connects to multiple Shopify, WooCommerce, and other stores from one account—manage products and fulfill orders across all stores without logging in and out.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        Does DSers support suppliers beyond AliExpress?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          Yes. DSers supports product sourcing and fulfillment from AliExpress, 1688, Alibaba.com, and Agent, helping sellers manage multi-supplier workflows from a single dashboard.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dsers-faq-item" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 0 12px 0;border:1px solid #e6edf5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;clear:both;">
      <button type="button" class="dsers-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:18px 20px;background:#ffffff;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:#111827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;">
        Is there a free plan?
        <span style="float:right;color:#1677ff;font-size:22px;line-height:1;" class="dsers-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="dsers-faq-answer" style="display:none;padding:0 20px 20px;color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          Yes. The Free Plan includes up to 3,000 products, 3 connected stores, 50 orders per month, and 1 user account. Upgrade to paid plans for higher limits, AI features, faster sync speeds, and priority support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var faqBlock = document.currentScript.closest('[data-dsers-faq-block]');
      if (!faqBlock) return;

      var triggers = faqBlock.querySelectorAll('.dsers-faq-trigger');

      triggers.forEach(function (trigger) {
        trigger.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var item = trigger.closest('.dsers-faq-item');
          var answer = item.querySelector('.dsers-faq-answer');
          var icon = item.querySelector('.dsers-faq-icon');
          var isOpen = trigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';

          trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen ? 'false' : 'true');
          answer.style.display = isOpen ? 'none' : 'block';
          icon.textContent = isOpen ? '+' : '–';

          item.style.borderColor = isOpen ? '#e6edf5' : '#bcd7ff';
          item.style.boxShadow = isOpen ? 'none' : '0 8px 24px rgba(22,119,255,0.06)';
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>

